cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use the PWG DE edition-graph sidecars, please cite them."
title: "PWG DE edition graph: OntoLex-Lemon + TEI Lex-0 sidecars"
type: dataset
abstract: >-
  The German side of the Petersburger Wörterbuch edition graph — 459 lexical
  entries / 11,581 edition senses from five editions (PWG, PW, SCH, PWKVN, NWS),
  each sense carrying structural layers recomputed from the German string:
  government frames, form notes, normalized citation edges, edition relations and
  non-German gloss spans. Serialized as OntoLex-Lemon (Turtle) and TEI Lex-0
  (XML). Contains no translation, no review score and no evidence grade.
